{"id":"wb-1-81","name":"大昭寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"大昭寺","text":"大昭寺是藏区卫藏地区的一座藏传佛教寺院，位于中华人民共和国西藏自治区拉萨市老城区八廓街，该寺院在藏传佛教中拥有至高无上的地位。大昭寺建成后经历代重新扩建，目前占地25100余平方米。\n2000年，大昭寺作为布达拉宫的扩展项目被列为世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E6%98%AD%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94844522,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94844522","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/a2c2bbe20bd9b2433e117d80.jpg","title":"Jokhang_Temple_Lhasa_Tibet_China_西藏_拉萨_大昭寺_-_panoramio_(5).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Jokhang_Temple_Lhasa_Tibet_China_%E8%A5%BF%E8%97%8F_%E6%8B%89%E8%90%A8_%E5%A4%A7%E6%98%AD%E5%AF%BA_-_panoramio_(5).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3d/Jokhang_Temple_Lhasa_Tibet_China_%E8%A5%BF%E8%97%8F_%E6%8B%89%E8%90%A8_%E5%A4%A7%E6%98%AD%E5%AF%BA_-_panoramio_%285%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Hiroki Ogawa","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"Jokhang Temple Lhasa Tibet China 西藏 拉萨 大昭寺","width":320,"height":240}}